<div class="lead" style="margin-bottom: var(--space-2xl);">
  Project Broadsheet is maintained by one person in his spare time. The docs are thorough and most questions have an answer there. For anything else, here's where to look.
</div>

<section class="section-sm">
  <h2 class="h3">Try these first</h2>
  <div class="grid grid-2" style="margin-top: var(--space-md);">
    <a class="card card--link" href="/docs/">
      <div class="card__eyebrow">Free · On your own</div>
      <h3 class="card__title">Read the docs</h3>
      <p class="card__summary">Guides for setting the site up, deploying it, changing how it looks, turning features on, and fixing things when they don't behave. The search always works.</p>
    </a>
    <a class="card card--link" href="{{ meta.github }}/discussions">
      <div class="card__eyebrow">Free · Ask around</div>
      <h3 class="card__title">Community discussions</h3>
      <p class="card__summary">Ask a question, share what you've built, or leave feedback. Other people running publications look in here. Teachers and students: there's a dedicated <strong>Schools &amp; Classrooms</strong> area for you.</p>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-sm">
  <h2 class="h3">Report something</h2>
  <div class="grid grid-2" style="margin-top: var(--space-md);">
    <a class="card card--link" href="/forms/bug-report/">
      <div class="card__eyebrow">Free</div>
      <h3 class="card__title">Something's broken</h3>
      <p class="card__summary">Tell me what you were doing, what you expected, and what actually happened. A browser and version helps.</p>
    </a>
    <a class="card card--link" href="/forms/feature-request/">
      <div class="card__eyebrow">Free</div>
      <h3 class="card__title">An idea for making it better</h3>
      <p class="card__summary">Something missing that you'd find useful? Send it over.</p>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-sm">
  <h2 class="h3">Paid help</h2>
  <p>If you'd rather have someone hands-on, you can hire me by the hour — see <a href="/pricing/">pricing</a> or <a href="/book-a-call/">get in touch</a>.</p>
</section>

<section class="section-sm">
  <h2 class="h3">Supporting the project</h2>
  <p>If Project Broadsheet saves you money or time, a contribution goes toward keeping it maintained and adding new things.</p>
  <div class="btn-group" style="margin-top: var(--space-md);">
